From: BashKitten contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Embed the pinned Termux:X11 engine through its private native host

Rebased 30 October 2026 onto 6dfb8b4a4cc887bc329284d31eb049d596bd1208.
Keep native upstream input/rendering fixes; remove standalone app discovery,
content logging and app-only hooks. Retains upstream GPL-3.0-only notices.

